# Alpha 2, v0.2.4: cut and divide (ARCHITECTURE §6 Cut / Slide / Divide, agreed 2026-11-21).
# Views: 0 3D, 1 Top (x right, y up), 2 Front (x right, z up), 3 Right. Grid 8, snap on.
vworld 2 0 0 0
wheel -3
vworld 1 0 0 0
wheel -3
wait 2
addbox 0 0 0 96 64 80
key Shift+X
expect tool Cut

# ---- Loop cut: point at an upright edge in the Front view, click, 1 cut at 50 %
toolset cut mode 1
vworld 2 0 0 40
wait 2
expect ring 0 4
press left
release left
wait 1
expect ring 1 4
key Return
wait 1
expect undo 2
expect faces 10
expect selected 4
expect selbounds 0 0 40 96 64 40

# ---- Two cuts at once, through the same ring (now the halves): spread evenly
vworld 2 96 0 20
wait 2
press left
release left
toolset cut cuts 2
key Return
wait 1
expect undo 3
expect faces 18

# ---- Knife across the top, from the front edge to the back edge (Top view)
toolset cut mode 0
vworld 1 24 0 80
wait 2
press left
release left
vworld 1 24 64 80
wait 2
press left
release left
expect knife 2
key Return
wait 1
expect undo 4
expect faces 21
expect knife 0

# ---- Mesh menu: subdivide the top 2x2, poke, divide an edge, connect two points
key 3
vworld 1 72 32 80
wait 2
key Shift+S
press left
release left
wait 1
expect selected 1
action mesh.subdivide
opset pieces 2 2
key Return
wait 1
expect undo 5
expect selected 4
action mesh.poke
opset height 8
key Return
wait 1
expect undo 6
expect bounds 0 0 0 96 64 88
expect selected 16

# ---- Slide: Alt+drag a corner along the bottom-front edge (Front view)
key Shift+V
key 1
hold alt
vworld 2 96 0 0
wait 2
press left
wait 1
vworld 2 88 0 0
wait 1
vworld 2 80 0 0
wait 1
release left
letgo alt
wait 1
expect undo 7
wait 2
shot a2-cut.png
quit
